Chart
- Bar chart
  Main purpose: Compare categories
  Typical use: Students in different faculties

- Pie chart
  Main purpose: Show proportions of a whole
  Typical use: Faculty-wise student percentages

- Scatter plot
  Main purpose: Examine relationships between two numerical variables
  Typical use: Study hours vs marks

- Histogram
  Main purpose: Show numerical data distributions
  Typical use: Distribution of exam marks

- Subplots
  Main purpose: Display multiple charts together
  Typical use: Compare scatter plot and histogram views